{"id":"wb-7-710","name":"琉璃河大桥","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"琉璃河大桥","text":"琉璃河大桥，也称琉璃河石桥，位于中华人民共和国北京市房山区琉璃河镇琉璃河街北侧的琉璃河上，是一座明代的石桥，在北京的石桥中规模仅次于卢沟桥。该桥在明清两代均有维修，中华人民共和国成立后一度作为公路桥使用。该桥全长165.5米，宽10.3米，高8米，共有11个桥孔。2013年，琉璃河大桥被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E6%B2%B3%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5","revisionId":85338624,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=85338624","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/2356e32a20351d7f756f8b18.jpg","title":"琉璃河大桥.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E6%B2%B3%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0a/%E7%90%89%E7%92%83%E6%B2%B3%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​琉璃河大桥桥面，自北向南拍摄","width":320,"height":237}}